    "/api/browser/install": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "browser"
        ],
        "summary": "Install",
        "description": "Stream Chromium install progress as SSE.\n\nEach event is a JSON line conforming to ``octop_browser.InstallEvent``:\n  ``{\"log\": \"...\"}``                              — progress line\n  ``{\"done\": true, \"success\": true}``             — finished OK\n  ``{\"done\": true, \"success\": false, \"error\": \"...\"}``  — failed\n\nIf a system Chrome/Chromium is already resolvable via ``find_chrome``,\nverify it with ``--version`` and short-circuit (no Playwright download).\nOtherwise delegate to ``install_chromium_stream`` (which runs its own\n``verify_chromium`` after download).\n\nReturns ``text/event-stream``; the client reads until ``done`` appears.",
        "operationId": "install_api_browser_install_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "access_token",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
